Browser events never reach the gamemode on SA-MP servers.

omp-cef (aurora-mp/omp-cef) v1.3.0 and v1.4.0, and the current main branch:
the SA-MP server plugin never drains the task queue, so nothing a page
emits (ui:click, auth:submit, ui:answer, phone:*) is ever delivered to Pawn.
Pages render, clicks vanish.

Why:
  - CefPlugin::EnqueueMainThreadTask() queues every client packet
    (src/server/common/plugin.cpp, PacketType::ClientEmitEvent);
  - CefPlugin::ProcessMainThreadTasks() is called from
    src/server/omp/component.cpp only - the open.mp component;
  - src/server/samp/main.cpp has no ProcessTick export and Supports()
    does not announce SUPPORTS_PROCESS_TICK, so SA-MP never calls back.

The fix is two files. Apply to a checkout of v1.4.0 (or main) with:

    git apply tools/cef-samp-processtick.patch

Then build the ServerSamp target (see .github/workflows/release.yml) or
let GitHub build it: fork the repository, push this change, open
Actions -> "Create Release" -> Run workflow (version, for example, 1.4.1)
and take cef-samp-1.4.1.zip from the release the workflow creates.

diff --git a/src/server/samp/main.cpp b/src/server/samp/main.cpp
--- a/src/server/samp/main.cpp
+++ b/src/server/samp/main.cpp
@@ -76,8 +76,19 @@
 PLUGIN_EXPORT unsigned int PLUGIN_CALL Supports()
 {
-    return sampgdk::Supports() | SUPPORTS_VERSION | SUPPORTS_AMX_NATIVES;
+    return sampgdk::Supports() | SUPPORTS_VERSION | SUPPORTS_AMX_NATIVES | SUPPORTS_PROCESS_TICK;
 }
 
+/*  SA-MP calls ProcessTick on every server tick. Without this export the
+    tasks queued by CefPlugin::EnqueueMainThreadTask are never run: the
+    open.mp component drains them from its own tick, the SA-MP plugin has
+    none. That is why nothing a page emits (ui:click, auth:submit,
+    ui:answer, phone:*) ever reaches the gamemode. */
+PLUGIN_EXPORT void PLUGIN_CALL ProcessTick()
+{
+    sampgdk::ProcessTick();
+    if (plugin_) plugin_->ProcessMainThreadTasks();
+}
+
 PLUGIN_EXPORT bool PLUGIN_CALL Load(void** ppData)
 {
     pAMXFunctions = ppData[PLUGIN_DATA_AMX_EXPORTS];
 
diff --git a/src/server/samp/plugin.def b/src/server/samp/plugin.def
--- a/src/server/samp/plugin.def
+++ b/src/server/samp/plugin.def
@@ -3,3 +3,4 @@
 	Load
 	Unload
+	ProcessTick
 	AmxLoad
